{
  "id": "Lyo.Pdf.Web.Components",
  "name": "Lyo.Pdf.Web.Components",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "Blazor / MudBlazor PDF workbenches: HTML to PDF, annotation, and `LyoPdfAnnotator` so drawn regions emit `PdfBoundingBox`.",
  "description": "Blazor / MudBlazor PDF UI: an HTML to PDF workbench, a\nPDF annotation workbench, and `LyoPdfAnnotator` so a user can draw bounding-box\nregions on a PDF and emit `PdfBoundingBox` payloads.\n\nTargets `net10.0`. Razor SDK with `FrameworkReference Microsoft.AspNetCore.App` and\n`MudBlazor` 9.3+.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Add annotator services",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddPdfAnnotatorService(); // IPdfAnnotatorService -> BrowserPdfAnnotator\nservices.AddPdfAnnotatorInterop(); // LyoPdfAnnotatorController (scoped)"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "list",
      "title": "Components",
      "items": [
        "`HtmlToPdfWorkbench.razor`. Paste HTML or upload an `.html` / `.htm` / `.txt` file, then turn it into a PDF through `IWebRendererService`.",
        "`PdfAnnotationWorkbench.razor`. Hosts `LyoPdfAnnotator` and shows a live table of saved annotations and their extracted payloads.",
        "`PdfAnnotator/LyoPdfAnnotator.razor` (+ `LyoPdfAnnotator.razor.cs`, `LyoPdfAnnotatorResultsView.razor`). Drawing canvas and result list. Fires `AnnotationsChanged` and `AnnotationsSaved`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "title": "Annotator services",
      "items": [
        "`IPdfAnnotatorService` (`BrowserPdfAnnotator`). After the user finishes annotating a PDF given as `Stream`, `byte[]`, or file path, returns `IReadOnlyDictionary<string, PdfBoundingBox>` (`AnnotateAsync` / `AnnotateFileAsync`).",
        "`LyoPdfAnnotatorController`. Scoped controller the Blazor components use.",
        "`LyoPdfAnnotationResult`. Payload for each saved region: `Key`, `BoundingBoxSummary`, `ExtractionType` (`BoundingBoxText`, `KeyValue`, `Table`), `ExtractedText`, optional `KeyValuePairs` / `TableRows`, `KnownKeys`, `TableHeaders`, `YTolerance`, `KeyValueLayout` (`PdfKeyValueLayout`), `InferFormattingFlags` (`PdfInferFormattingFlags`), `KeyValueInferDelimiters`, `TableKeyColumnLabel`, `ColumnCount`, and `ColumnTexts`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "DI registration",
      "text": "Pair with [`Lyo.Pdf`](../Lyo.Pdf/README.md)'s `AddPdfService(...)` so the annotator can call `IPdfReader.Text` for bounding-box extraction."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Browser scripts",
      "text": "Scripts sit under `wwwroot/scripts/`. Point at them from the host page or via the usual Razor class-library `_content/Lyo.Pdf.Web.Components/` path."
    }
  ],
  "links": [],
  "readmePath": "Lyo.Net/Data/Pdf/Lyo.Pdf.Web.Components/README.md",
